post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
Yoru is at /usr/bin/yoru. Starting him at login and the key that hides him
are your Hyprland config, which a package does not write. Two lines:

  ~/.config/hypr/autostart.lua
    o.launch_on_start("/usr/bin/yoru")

  ~/.config/hypr/bindings.lua
    o.bind("SUPER + CTRL + Y", "Toggle Yoru", "pkill -USR1 -f 'python3 /usr/bin/yoru( |$)'")

Autostart takes effect at your next login; until then:  yoru &
Try the knobs first:  yoru --interval 20 --roam 20 --idle 0
MSG
}
